{"availability":"available","full":"flizy0/deskyrin","name":"deskyrin","description":"Deskyrin — auto-updating Solana ecosystem report and interactive dashboard","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-21T08:15:52Z","updated":"2026-10-08T14:57:36Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://deskyrin-gamma.vercel.app","topics":["analytics","dashboard","github-actions","solana","vercel"],"demo":"https://deskyrin-gamma.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:32.927Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:32.927Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:05:32.927Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:48.558Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:05:32.927Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Deskyrin is an auto-updating Solana network and ecosystem report with a dark analytical terminal, generated Markdown, and machine-readable JSON. It runs without a wallet, database, persistent backend, paid API, or mandatory API key.","Live dashboard: deskyrin-gamma.vercel.app Generated outputs: public/data.json · public/report.md Full methodology: docs/methodology.md Frozen bounty scope: docs/research/00-frozen-master-scope.md","These are deterministic, domain-specific engineering choices rather than AI/ML claims: the alert thresholds are fixed and documented, Allium/Dune observations arrive through the Solana Foundation data aggregator, and the sampled fee is an estimate rather than an exact network-wide median."],"features":["Evidence-first source correlation: fee observations from Allium and Dune are reconciled on the same completed UTC date, then joined to matching Jito gross tips to derive an auditable REV total. Provider values, ranges,…","Explainable, noise-resistant alerts: TPS and slot-time checks use duration-weighted samples, two adjacent recent bins, a median prior-hour baseline, and simultaneous relative and absolute thresholds. Validator…","Derived on-chain fee sampling: the median transaction fee is calculated directly from finalized Solana blocks selected through a deterministic 16-block stratified sample across an approximately 9,000-slot window. The…","Failure-aware state without a database: the previous validated snapshot acts as bounded state. Independent domains can retain explicit stale last-known-good values when a provider fails, while healthy domains continue…","Auditable presentation from one canonical snapshot: the dashboard, interactive source-history tables, generated Markdown, alerts, and machine-readable JSON all derive from the same validated artifact. The browser…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flizy0/deskyrin/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a05f3a3a28d5d378c483d508239c5f2b51ddaa28a8cdc9933244352f540e735a","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:48.639Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:14.059Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Deskyrin is an auto-updating Solana network and ecosystem report with a dark analytical terminal, generated Markdown, and machine-readable JSON. It runs without a wallet, database, persistent backend, paid API, or mandatory API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flizy0/deskyrin/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"PUBLICDATAURL, MAXDATAAGEMINUTES, and EXPECTEDSCHEMAVERSION remain configurable repository variables; no custom secret or API key is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flizy0/deskyrin/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a05f3a3a28d5d378c483d508239c5f2b51ddaa28a8cdc9933244352f540e735a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flizy0/deskyrin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:14.059Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T14:57:36Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/flizy0/deskyrin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:09:14.060Z","hash":"a05f3a3a28d5d378c483d508239c5f2b51ddaa2